# VQ-Atom: Reproducibility Guide (Anonymous)

This repository provides minimal instructions to reproduce the main DTI experiments in the paper.

---

## 1. Setup

```bash
git clone https://github.com/<anonymous>/neurips_2026.git
cd neurips_2026

pip install ogb googledrivedownloader category_encoders einops pyyaml gdown matplotlib entmax
pip install transformers accelerate
```

---

## 2. Pretrained Models

Download pretrained checkpoints:

```bash
cd data

# Transformer (ligand MLM)
gdown https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1MVFevAOYB6omHQmoP2BHTq4BJoXL4HCH

# VQ-Atom quantization model
gdown https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1d3WxI54Ae0Am_5RIAGf7TW98JI_uuYRS
```

---

## 3. Dataset

Download processed KIBA splits:

```bash
gdown https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1eUB8CztDIttksV4FfHml55pcVbrrjs03
gdown https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1zaAL-3XWNbVmieojKf0K8HZaPEtt9Sfx
gdown https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1fxJHq0XdNFJwZx4yHKg8XfYtc7894-5N
```

Files:

* `train.csv`
* `valid.csv`
* `test.csv`

---

## 4. Training (DTI)

```bash
cd src

python dti.py \
  --use_train_valid_csv \
  --train_csv ../data/train.csv \
  --valid_csv ../data/valid.csv \
  --final_eval_csv ../data/test.csv \
  --lig_ckpt ../data/mlm_ep65.pt \
  --vq_ckpt ../data/model_epoch_3.pt \
  --out_dir ./log/ \
  --batch_size 16 \
  --epochs 30 \
  --lr 3e-5 \
  --dropout 0.4 \
  --weight_decay 0.05 \
  --llrd \
  --llrd_decay 0.97 \
  --esm_lr_mult 0.1 \
  --n_heads 8 \
  --attn_temp 1.5 \
  --attn_activation sigmoid \
  --protein_token_dropout 0.10 \
  --ligand_token_dropout 0.10 \
  --finetune_esm \
  --finetune_lig \
  --plateau \
  --seed 4 \
  --reg_lambda 0.2 \
  --sym_lambda 0 \
  --attn_entropy_lambda 0 \
  --y_thr 12.1 \
  --freeze_esm_bottom 28 \
  --warmup_ratio 0.05 \
  --pl_lp_overlap both
```

---

## Notes

* The setup focuses on reproducing the main experimental setting (protein-cold KIBA).
* All hyperparameters are fixed to match the reported configuration.
* Results may vary slightly due to randomness.

---

